     1	# Finance record frontmatter
     2	
     3	Finance notes are gradually migrating toward YAML frontmatter so they stay readable in Obsidian while exposing structured fields for automation.
     4	
     5	When a task asks you to OCR, normalize, or structure a finance note:
     6	
     7	- extract visible data from the existing note body into YAML frontmatter
     8	- preserve the existing note body below the frontmatter as the source OCR or human-readable content
     9	- do not invent fields that are not supported by the visible note
    10	- if the visible invoice or bill data does not mention a currency, assume euros for `total_eur`, `unit_eur`, and `line_eur`
