    39	
    40	- `record_type`
    41	- `invoice_number`
    42	- `alias`
    43	- `issued_on`
    44	- `total_eur`
    45	- `counterparty`
    46	- `project`
    47	- `lines`
    48	
    49	Optional invoice fields:
    50	
    51	- `related_entity`
    52	
    53	Invoice line rules:
    54	
    55	- `lines` is an ordered list and should follow the visible line-item order from the note
    56	- each line item must include:
    57	  - `item`
    58	  - `quantity`
    59	  - `unit_eur`
    60	  - `line_eur`
